{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"145407","name":"VP SOGNIO Madroño","description":"This splendid hotel is ideally located in the exclusive district of Salamanca, within walking distance of the Goya and Serrano shopping streets and about 7 km from the centre of Madrid. Thanks to its great traffic connections, the property offers easy access to the main sites of the city such as museums, parks and local monuments. Renovated in 2010, this air-conditioned hotel offers a lovely private garden and spacious rooms with a stylish, bright decoration, offering a relaxing atmosphere, ideal to unwind after a busy day of work or sightseeing. Room facilities such as free Wi-Fi, a fully-equipped kitchenette and complimentary water and soft drinks for the first night, will enhance guests' stay and make their visit to the city a memorable one. Every morning a delicious breakfast buffet is served in the hotel and guests can find many dining options surrounding the property. Other services include private parking as well as meeting facilities .","address":"General Diaz Porlier, 101","city":"MADRID","countryCode":"ES","postalCode":"28006","lat":40.43519,"lng":-3.676484,"stars":3,"chain":"VPHOT","giataCode":"104078","phone":"+34915625292","email":"MD@VPHOTELES.COM","website":"www.madrono-hotel.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/14/145407/145407a_hb_a_015_20260831_143949.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/14/145407/145407a_hb_a_013.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/14/145407/145407a_hb_a_011.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/14/145407/145407a_hb_a_012.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/14/145407/145407a_hb_a_014_20251202_031851.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/14/145407/145407a_hb_l_00